@startuml
title Analysis and Scoring Implementation Pipeline

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  BorderColor #334155
  DiamondBackgroundColor #E2E8F0
  DiamondBorderColor #334155
  FontColor #0F172A
}
skinparam arrowColor #475569

start
:CLI validates the GitHub target,
loads configuration, and resolves the ref;
:Project Inspector fetches repository metadata,
package.json, and the npm lockfile;
:Build the complete internal dependency graph;

fork
  :Dirty-Waters Adapter;
  :Parse external static-analysis output;
fork again
  :Custom manifest rules;
  :Classify npm dependency declarations;
fork again
  :Package Governance Detector;
  :Query npm, DNS, and RDAP metadata;
fork again
  :PeerSpin Detector;
  :Model and verify peer conflicts;
fork again
  :Source-Usage Detector;
  :Run Knip on an isolated source snapshot;
fork again
  :npm Audit Vulnerability Analyzer;
  :Normalize vulnerability and advisory evidence;
end fork

:Collect detector findings, package metadata,
and vulnerability results;
:Enrich findings with vulnerability evidence;
:Evaluate package responsiveness and update strategy;
:Enrich findings with responsiveness evidence;
:Aggregate pipeline warnings;
:Apply SSSS scoring to every finding;

fork
  :Generate the analysis-results.json with smell dependencies and immediate parents;
fork again
  :Generate the textual analysis-report.md with smell dependencies;
end fork

stop
@enduml
